# A Structure launched over itself whose code declares one variable twice at its root level (the book, call-receivers
# and names and paths): the bare name selects no occurrence -- answer 3.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds the call main().
sub: main () (
    Self:
        int: x 5
        int: x 6
        x := x + 1
)
    call(Self)
main()
